# Iron Spider, Stark Upgrade's "{2}, Remove two +1/+1 counters from among artifacts you control: Draw a card." Only artifacts'
# counters count. On turn 1 Bot1 casts the Spider with Black Lotus's {W}{W}{W}, a Bagel and Schmear with Mox Emerald and Savannah
# Lions (no artifact) with a Plains. On turn 3 the Bagel's Share puts a +1/+1 counter on the Lions (Mox Pearl's {W}) and the Spider
# taps for a counter on itself (the Lions, no artifact creature, get none). With {2} in the pool and two +1/+1 counters on Bot1's
# permanents, only one of them on an artifact, the draw can't be paid.

